Sangavai C, Chellapandi P. A metabolic study to decipher amino acid catabolism-directed biofuel synthesis in <i>Acetoanaerobium sticklandii</i> DSM 519. Amino Acids. 2019;51:1397&#x2013;407.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">31471743</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Takahashi S, Tomita J, Nishioka Ket al. Development of a prokaryotic universal primer for simultaneous analysis of bacteria and archaea using next-generation sequencing. PLoS One. 2014;9:e105592.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC4140814</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">25144201</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>
