signment of rRNA sequences into the new bacterial taxonomy. Appl Environ Microbiol. 2007;73:5261&#x2013;7.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC1950982</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">17586664</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Whiticar MJ. Carbon and hydrogen isotope systematics of bacterial formation and oxidation of methane. Chem Geol. 1999;161:291&#x2013;314.</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>Wik M, Varner RK, Anthony KW et al. Climate-sensitive northern lakes and ponds are critical components of methane release. Nat Geosci. 2016;9:99&#x2013;105.</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>
