Sci. Rep. 2016;6:463.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC4828714</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">27067514</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Parks DH, et al. CheckM: assessing the quality of microbial genomes recovered from isolates, single cells, and metagenomes. Genome Res. 2015;25:1043&#x2013;1055.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC4484387</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">25977477</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Karst, S. M., Kirkegaard, R. H. &amp; Albertsen, M. mmgenome: a toolbox for reproducible genome extraction from metagenomes. <i>bioRxiv</i>&#xa0;10.1101/059121 (2016).</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>Hyatt D, Locascio PF, Hauser LJ, Uberbacher EC. Gene and translation initiation site prediction in metagenomic sequences. Bioinformatics. 2012;28:2223&#x2013;2230.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">22796954</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Kanehisa M, Goto S. KEGG: Kyoto encyclopedia of genes and genomes. Nucleic Acids Res. 2000;28:27&#x2013;30.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC102409</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">10592173</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Galperin MY, Makarova KS, Wolf YI, Koonin EV. Expanded microbial genome coverage and improved protein family annotation in the COG database. Nucleic Acids Res. 2014;43:D261&#x2013;D269.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC4383993</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">25428365</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Srere PA, Brazil H, Gonen L. The citrate condensing enzyme of Pigeon breast muscle and moth flight muscle. Acta Chem. Scand. 1963;17:129&#x2013;134.</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>Casta&#xf1;o-Cerezo S, Bernal V, C&#xe1;novas M. Acetyl-coenzyme A synthetase (Acs) assay. Bio-Protocol. 2012;2:e256.</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>S&#xe1