Beijing: Science Press.</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>Yang Y. Y., Zhao Q., Cui Y. H., Wang Y. L., Xie S. G., Liu Y. (2016). Spatio-temporal variation of sediment methanotrophic microorganisms in a large eutrophic lake.
